      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "听到这句话后，我忽然想起\n在远处凝视她的粉丝。即使有些强硬，\n若能制造机会让她们交流的话──",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff0fffe26b85bff495f09e901eb6eabd4b72f2abb8bd18cde5abb4760f841fd6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
